/PAn {newpath tMatrix currentmatrix pop translate 0 0 moveto scale
  0 0 1 5 -2 roll arcn closepath tMatrix setmatrix fill} bdef
/vradius 0 def /hradius 0 def /lry 0 def
/lrx 0 def /uly 0 def /ulx 0 def /rad 0 def
